ta ,\\,2r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $r\\in [0,\\infty )$ and $\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).$\n\nTherefore, the third component of $f$ is $2r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077759/state.json" "file_sha256" "3710e4c5d31ce4e3f9a675ffa398abacc80a1ab3c7038e133629e862488dd7a8" "basis" 2812 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077759/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-164539" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077759/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6c82fe7814da75f780ed20aabef787d42b88088ae491cb3047a018b2fc098949" "basis" 2812 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077759/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-164539" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077759/state.json" "file_sha256" "3710e4c5d31ce4e3f9a675ffa398abacc80a1ab3c7038e133629e862488dd7a8" "basis" 2812 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077759/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-164539" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "2r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta "] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14077759/state.json" "file_sha256" "3710e4c5d31ce4e3f9a675ffa398abacc80a1ab3c7038e133629e862488dd7a8" "basis" 2812 "verification" 